OL,3,GNEWSAMan accused of triple murder
OL,4,Aadmits gun charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of killing his wife and
OL,7,Ftwo daughters in the UK has admitted
OL,8,Funlawful possession of a firearm and
OL,9,Fammunition in South Africa.
OL,11,FNothabo Zandile Tshuma, 42, and her
OL,12,Fdaughters Natalie, 15, and Nala, five,
OL,13,Fwere found with fatal head injuries in
OL,14,FGreat Denham, near Bedford, on 7 July.
OL,16,FNdodana Mkhanyisi Tshuma, 45, was
OL,17,Farrested in Johannesburg after leaving
OL,18,Fthe UK. Local police said he was found
OL,19,Fwith a gun and ammunition he had bought
OL,20,Fin South Africa. He has appeared before
OL,21,Fmagistrates in the city for a plea
OL,22,Fhearing.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
